)">better&nbsp;source&nbsp;needed</span></a></i>]</sup> <a href=3D"https://=
en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jazz_poetry" title=3D"Jazz poetry">Jazz poet</a> <a h=
ref=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gil_Scott-Heron" title=3D"Gil Scott-He=
ron">Gil Scott-Heron</a> wrote a poem called "<a href=3D"https://en.wikiped=
ia.org/wiki/Whitey_on_the_Moon" title=3D"Whitey on the Moon">Whitey on the =
Moon</a>" (1970) expressing his view that the mission was emblematic of <a =
href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Racial_inequality_in_the_United_State=
s" title=3D"Racial inequality in the United States">racial inequality in th=
e United States</a>.<sup id=3D"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEChaikin200757_228-2" class=
=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apollo_11#cite_note=
-FOOTNOTEChaikin200757-228"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>226<span c=
